        "content": "## Section 1 — Database Schema\nCreates all AI OS tables with CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS and seeds default config rows. Idempotent and safe to re-run. Fails soft (onError continue) so Drive setup still runs.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300
      },
